OL,3,APlan for controversial Sydney data
OL,4,Acentre scrapped after push-back
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a data centre which would
OL,7,Fhave been built metres from people's
OL,8,Fhomes in a Sydney suburb have been
OL,9,Fscrapped following intense push-back by
OL,10,Fcampaigners.
OL,12,FThe data centre was being developed by
OL,13,FGoodman Group, Australia's biggest
OL,14,Fproperty company, and would have seen
OL,15,Fit construct a A$1.2bn (#630m; $841m),
OL,16,F90-megawatt facility known as Project
OL,17,FMars in the Lane Cove area.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
